  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. This is the initial SDK release for Amazon AI Operations (AIOps). AIOps is a generative AI-powered assistant that helps you respond to incidents in your system by scanning your system's telemetry and quickly surface suggestions that might be related to your issue.",
